[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15060.55, "timestamp": "04:11:00", "text": "女王并不完全是个马龙人。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15093.349, "timestamp": "04:11:33", "text": "你嫉妒所有印度人吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15097.229, "timestamp": "04:11:37", "text": "人口，一半的人口"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15098.83, "timestamp": "04:11:38", "text": "印度？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15101.99, "timestamp": "04:11:41", "text": "呃，我不知道。我的意思是，也有一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15104.95, "timestamp": "04:11:44", "text": "我内心深处对学校的看法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15107.83, "timestamp": "04:11:47", "text": "人们就这样去上大学"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15109.91, "timestamp": "04:11:49", "text": "以及学校。还有我的一部分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15112.63, "timestamp": "04:11:52", "text": "就像“我很高兴不用学习”一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15115.83, "timestamp": "04:11:55", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。但在这个社会中，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15117.75, "timestamp": "04:11:57", "text": "关键是你必须做出"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15119.91, "timestamp": "04:11:59", "text": "给自己取个名字，并拥有一张照片"}]